OL,3,GNEWSATeacher's 'over friendly' emails
OL,4,A'cross boundary'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA formal inquiry into "over friendly"
OL,7,Femails sent by a teacher to his
OL,8,Fstudents has heard he was sacked
OL,9,Ffollowing the correspondence, which
OL,10,Fbroached topics including drinking
OL,11,Falcohol and going out at night.
OL,13,FDavid Brereton was dismissed from
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent Sixth Form College in
OL,15,F2022 after it emerged he had been
OL,16,Fregularly emailing students about
OL,17,Fnon-education matters, the proceedings
OL,18,Fwere told.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
