OL,3,GNEWSATeacher's 'over friendly' emails
OL,4,A'cross boundary'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA professional conduct panel is
OL,7,Fscrutinising his actions in relation to
OL,8,Ftwo students, with the Teaching
OL,9,FRegulation Agency (TRA) maintaining the
OL,10,Femails "blur and then cross
OL,11,Fboundaries".
OL,13,FBrereton did not attend the virtual
OL,14,Fproceedings and was not represented.
OL,15,FThe panel's hearing continues.
